Install the configuration system wide (Red Hat did the same in 1997):
readFile() includes each .fvwm2rc.* file from $HOME when the user has a
copy there, otherwise from TNL_DIR (passed to FvwmM4 by the bootstrap).
FvwmM4 in fvwm 2.6+ defines FVWM_MODULEDIR instead of FVWMDIR, and
PixmapPath/IconPath became ImagePath. TraceForErrors prints to stderr
instead of issuing invalid commands on purpose.

